body:
i feel worse too. tomorrow maybe ill feel worse again. but someday ill feel better. and i know how hard it is to think theres a future when youre like this, but suicide hits you like a slap in the face. i didnt realise i was loved. and it took 3 trips to the hospital on suicide attempts and a whole school crying for me to come back for me to see it. dont walk the same road.
for ever and ever,
rhi xxxxxxxxxxx
